	.SBTTL	COPYRIGHT PROTECTION MESSAGE

; THIS TABLE REPRESENTS A MESSAGE WHICH CAN
; BE READ DURING SELF TEST IF THE PROGRAM
; EPROM (2732) IS PLUGGED INTO ONE OF THE TWO PICTURE
; EPROM'S (2716'S).  NOTE THAT BOTH 2716'S MUST BE
; REMOVED.  THIS FILE MUST BE INSERTED BETWEEN
; RELATIVE ADDRESS 200 AND 400 OR 600 AND 800 OF THE 
; 2732 SO THAT IT WILL APPEAR IN THE RIGHT HAND 
; COLUMNS OF SELF TEST.  IF THE START OF THIS TABLE
; IS NOT INSERTED ON AN 8 BYTE BOUNDARY THEN THE
; MESSAGE WILL BE SPLIT AND UNREADABLE ON THE SCREEN.


